sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant I as Identity provider
  participant S as Warp SQL server
  C->>I: sign in (the provider's own way)
  I-->>C: an ID token
  C->>S: POST /warp/v1/auth/token<br/>{"grant_type": "token_exchange", "subject_token": <ID token>}
  Note over S: verifies issuer, audience, expiry, signature<br/>and maps the token to a principal
  S-->>C: 200 the server's own access token
